---
body:

Checks every registration against [StopForumSpam](https://www.stopforumspam.com)'s database of known spammer usernames, email addresses and IP addresses. A match at or above the configured confidence score is rejected, and the attempt is logged for admins to review.

Members who are allowed to ban users also get a "Report spammer" button on profiles. It reports the account to StopForumSpam and can ban it at the same time. Reporting needs a StopForumSpam [API key](https://www.stopforumspam.com/keys).

After installing, run the migrations with `flaskbb db upgrade`.
